Ferreira served as Minister of Environment (1995–1999) and as Minister for Planning (1999–2001) in the government of António Guterres.
906	1062	Member of the European Parliament, 2004–2016
Ferreira was a Member of the European Parliament from the 2004 European election until her resignation in 2016.
